  "story": "Numbers arrive one at a time. After each one, report the median of all the numbers so far: the middle one in sorted order, or with an even count the smaller of the two middle ones. There can be 1500 numbers, so keeping them all in order costs too many steps. Two heaps keep the middle in reach: the smaller half in a MAX heap, the larger half in a MIN heap.",
